:NetworkActivity_Instance :hasNetworkActivityOutcome false ;
    rdfs:comment "Network Activity designated by nbn in respect of an nbn Ethernet Ordered Product to attempt to achieve the CIR Objective. If unsuccessful, the Charge under section 7 will not apply. [extension: nbn Ethernet Price List, Section 7(d)(i), p.19]" .

